# Article text and HTML caches stay local, as in the team repo.
kb/internal/
# The Obsidian vault is versioned, as on main; only per-user window state stays local.
kb/obsidian/.obsidian/workspace.json
kb/obsidian/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
# articles/ IS versioned: the official runs are the source the knowledge base's model-mapped
# rows are rebuilt from, as kb/mermaid_code/ is for the hand-drawn ones. They hold short
# quotes (a sentence or two), as the hand-drawn maps do, never the full text.
# cache/ IS versioned too: with the saved answers anyone can replay the official runs without
# a key, at no cost, and get the same output.

# Run state and secrets.
/runs/
*.sqlite
.env
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
